  "description_text": "Are you Looking for a home for the holiday's, that is ready to move in come check out this rehab home that offers 6 Bedrooms, 2 Full baths and full finished basement. 3 Bedrooms in the main level along with 1 bath, very spacious living room with beautiful Bay Windows that capture sunlight across more hours of the day. Combined kitchen and dining area creates an open, social layout perfect for the family gatherings. The full finished basement offers 3 bedrooms, 1 full bath additional living space and the laundry room. New waterproof vinyl flooring throughout the home. Property has a 2 car garage and a huge driveway to accomidate a big family. Roof is only 3 years old, garage roof and siding is also 3 years old. New plumbing and electrical throughout. The backyard is pretty spacious and offers the backdoor that gives you access to Stevenson Middle School but also Rainey Park, Playground and Volleyball court. Property is located in a great location minutes away from 79th St, Pulaski and Cicero Ave.",
